# Brand logo on marketing

Any flyer, postcard, social graphic, Canva design, or print piece for Vitality Sweat / Vitality Engine must include the official Vitality Sweat logo.

Logo sources (prefer these, do not invent a mark):
- Repo: `public/branding/logo-original-transparent.png` (and sibling SVG/PNG variants)
- Live: `https://vitalitysweat.com/branding/logo-original-transparent.png`
- Drive logos folder: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vISMWPat6EAdUNjNw7_fNe7tppgZOOTW
- Canva: Vitality Sweat Brand Kit (`kAHQmrFxWVQ`) plus uploaded logo assets

Placement: clear, high-contrast, not cropped. Use black/original on light surfaces; white variants on dark athletic planes.
